{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "limit of x*x/(x^2 + x^2) as x -> 0:\n  0/0: L'Hôpital: lim (2x)/(4x) = lim 0.5\n  = 1/2 (from both sides)\n  numeric from the left (a - h, h = 0.1*2^-k, k = 0..21): 0.5, 0.5, 0.5, 0.5, 0.5, 0.5\n    extrapolated (Richardson): 0.5 (estimated error 0): agrees\n  numeric from the right (a + h, h = 0.1*2^-k, k = 0..21): 0.5, 0.5, 0.5, 0.5, 0.5, 0.5\n    extrapolated (Richardson): 0.5 (estimated error 0): agrees\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 1, "ok": true, "cmd": "limit", "ucas": "limit (x*x)/(x^2+x^2) at (0)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "limit", "var": "x", "at": "0", "side": "both", "limit": {"kind": "number", "value": 0.5, "text": "1/2"}}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "numeric_left", "points": 22, "max_diff": 0, "passed": true, "text": "Richardson-extrapolated values approaching the point"}, {"kind": "numeric_right", "points": 22, "max_diff": 0, "passed": true, "text": "Richardson-extrapolated values approaching the point"}], "files": [], "text": "limit of x*x/(x^2 + x^2) as x -> 0:\n  0/0: L'Hôpital: lim (2x)/(4x) = lim 0.5\n  = 1/2 (from both sides)\n  numeric from the left (a - h, h = 0.1*2^-k, k = 0..21): 0.5, 0.5, 0.5, 0.5, 0.5, 0.5\n    extrapolated (Richardson): 0.5 (estimated error 0): agrees\n  numeric from the right (a + h, h = 0.1*2^-k, k = 0..21): 0.5, 0.5, 0.5, 0.5, 0.5, 0.5\n    extrapolated (Richardson): 0.5 (estimated error 0): agrees\n"}, "isError": false}}
